 and boosts Elemental Skill DMG and overall Elemental DMG, making it a strong 5-star alternative for Varesa."},{"name":"Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds","text":"High CRIT Rate with an Elemental DMG bonus that stacks during on-field time."},{"name":"Crane's Echoing Call","text":"High Base ATK and Plunging Attack team support after the wielder Plunges; value depends on Plunge usage."},{"name":"The Widsith","text":"Provides 55.1% CRIT DMG and a random ATK, Elemental DMG, or EM buff, offering strong but inconsistent damage boosts for Varesa."},{"name":"Flowing Purity","text":"A craftable ATK% catalyst that increases Elemental DMG after Skill use. Healing clears its Bond of Life for an extra damage bonus."},{"name":"Winter's Heavy Heart","text":"CRIT DMG with buffs based on Cryo/Electro allies; specialized for Stellar Glimmer teams, often only a stat stick here. Depends on Cryo/Electro party members."},{"name":"Blackcliff Agate","text":"CRIT DMG catalyst with an ATK boost after defeating enemies; weak against single bosses."}],"a":[{"names":["Long Night's Oath"],"text":"Greatly increases Plunging Attack damage by building stacks from Varesa’s combat actions. One of her strongest overall sets.","stats":"ATK% · Electro DMG Bonus/ATK% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Obsidian Codex"],"text":"Grants 40% CRIT Rate after consuming Nightsoul points, making it a powerful alternative for Varesa. Avoid overcapping CRIT Rate.","stats":""},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Provides 36% ATK, making it a solid 2-piece combination for boosting Varesa’s Plunging Attack damage.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Plunge & Punishment","members":["Varesa","Mavuika","Iansan","Chevreuse"],"text":"Varesa drives Plunging Attack damage, Mavuika adds off-field Pyro and buffs, Iansan boosts ATK, and Chevreuse provides healing, ATK buffs, and Pyro/Electro RES shred.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Buffs","Support"]},{"name":"Natlan CrossFit","members":["Varesa","Durin","Iansan",